{
  "$comment": "Shared UTF-16 <-> UTF-8 byte offset conversion vectors, consumed identically by web/test/byte-offsets.test.ts (TypeScript) and tests/FlashTeX.Protocol.Tests/ByteOffsetsCrossLanguageParityTests.cs (C#). Every rangeVectors entry must round-trip through both ByteOffsets.Utf16RangeForUtf8Bytes/Utf8ByteRangeForUtf16Range (C#) and utf16RangeForUtf8Bytes/utf8ByteRangeForUtf16Range (TS). Every invalidVectors entry must return null from the named direction. Do not hand-edit offsets without recomputing byte/char cumulative sums by hand -- see the generation notes in byte-offsets.test.ts.",
